[117.563, "o", "\r\nRe-triaged all 14 open issues, including those that already had labels. The triage report is in `/triage.md`.\r\n\r\nLabels were applied to 13 issues; issue #10\u2019s label entry was dropped by the reviewer. Issue #12 was commented on as a duplicate of #4; no comment was applied to #11.\r\n"]
